## Bootstrap

1. Push this exported repository to Git.
2. Replace `https://git.example.com/{{ project_slug }}.git` in the Argo manifests with your real `repoURL`.
3. Apply:

```bash
kubectl apply -f deploy/argocd/AppProject.yaml
kubectl apply -f deploy/argocd/root-app.yaml
```

No secret values are embedded in these manifests.
